{"title":"Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)","startsAt":"2026-10-25T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-25T17:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Hello everyone,\n\nI'd like to invite you out to a fun-filled afternoon with this fantastic social game called **MUSIC BINGO with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nEveryone can play (It's easy to learn and most of all it's a lot of fun!)\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\nSincerely,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Details of Event:**\n**Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nMusic Bingo puts a fun musical twist on traditional bingo. Instead of listening for numbers, you'll hear familiar songs from across the decades and mark them off on your Music Bingo card.\n\nYou don't need to be a music expert — recognizing the songs, singing along and enjoying the company is all part of the fun!\n\n• **Seven decades of great music** with plenty of familiar favourites\n• **Treats for our winning participants** during the different rounds\n• **Meet and mingle** with a friendly group while enjoying a relaxed social atmosphere\n• **Come on your own or invite some friends** — we'll get everyone settled in and ready to play\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nYour event fee includes **Music Bingo, treats for our winners, reserved seating and plenty of music, laughs and fun throughout the event.**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer, please include **your name** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nBring your music memories, your sense of humour and maybe even your singing voice — although singing along is completely optional!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\nPlease arrive between **2:00 PM and 2:30 PM** so you'll have time to get settled, meet some people and get ready to play. **Music Bingo will begin shortly afterward.**\n\n\\*Great lunch menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)","venue":{"name":"The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub","address":"1999 Avenue Rd, North York, ON M5M 4A5, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.735195,"lng":-79.41965,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Soul City Social Club (Toronto, Canada)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/f/4/c/highres_536188492.jpeg"}